# Dedicated location for Aila Nano 50M checkpoints, kept separate from the
# shipped 20M ones (checkpoints/finetune_20m, checkpoints/pretrain_20m).
# Training writes:
#   checkpoints/50m/pretrain/   (pretraining run)
#   checkpoints/50m/finetune/   (instruction / conversation fine-tune)
# The .pt weights themselves are gitignored; this file just keeps the
# directory in the tree so the layout is documented and reproducible.
